+  def test_measured_law_is_gated_to_normal_mode(self):
+    """The inverse is a property of the ACCELERATOR MAP, which Hyundai changes with the drive mode (ECO dulls it, SPORT
+    sharpens it). The table was fit on route 17c, which ran in NORMAL, so ECO / SPORT / N / N-custom and an undecoded
